      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El primer hermano, Hiranyaksha, era un guerrero terrible. En esos días, la tierra se había hundido en el océano.",
          "en": "The first brother, Hiranyaksha, was a fearsome warrior. In those days, the earth had sunk into the ocean."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Bhagavata Purana cuenta que Vishnu se volvió Varaha, un jabalí gigante, y se lanzó al agua.",
          "en": "The Bhagavata Purana tells how Vishnu became Varaha, a giant boar, and dived into the water."
        },
        {
          "es": "Luchó contra Hiranyaksha y lo venció.",
          "en": "He fought Hiranyaksha and defeated him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Después levantó la tierra sobre sus colmillos y la devolvió a su lugar.",
          "en": "Then he lifted the earth up on his tusks and set it back in its place."
        }
      ],
