      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Prahlada había aprendido a amar a Vishnu antes de nacer, escuchando al sabio Narada.",
          "en": "Prahlada had learned to love Vishnu before he was even born, listening to the sage Narada."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus maestros quisieron enseñarle política y guerra. Prahlada solo hablaba de Vishnu.",
          "en": "His teachers tried to teach him politics and war. Prahlada spoke only of Vishnu."
        },
        {
          "es": "\"¿Qué es lo mejor que has aprendido?\", le preguntó su padre. \"Amar a Vishnu\", dijo el niño.",
          "en": "\"What is the best thing you have learned?\" asked his father. \"To love Vishnu,\" said the boy."
        },
        {
          "es": "El rey temblaba de rabia.",
          "en": "The king shook with rage."
        }
