        {
          "es": "El rey ordenó castigar a su hijo. Pero nada podía hacerle daño.",
          "en": "The king ordered his son to be punished. But nothing could harm him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mandaron elefantes enormes para aplastarlo. Los elefantes no lo tocaron.",
          "en": "Huge elephants were sent to crush him. The elephants would not touch him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo arrojaron al fuego. Las llamas no lo quemaron.",
          "en": "He was thrown into a fire. The flames did not burn him."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Bhagavata Purana dice que Prahlada solo seguía rezando, tranquilo, pensando en Vishnu.",
          "en": "The Bhagavata Purana says Prahlada just kept praying, calm, with his mind on Vishnu."
        }
