      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Era el atardecer: ni de día ni de noche.",
          "en": "It was twilight: not day, and not night."
        },
        {
          "es": "Narasimha llevó al rey hasta el umbral de la puerta: ni dentro ni fuera.",
          "en": "Narasimha carried the king to the doorway: not inside, and not outside."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo puso sobre sus rodillas: ni en la tierra ni en el cielo.",
          "en": "He placed him on his lap: not on the ground, and not in the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y con sus garras, no con un arma, acabó con el rey demonio.",
          "en": "And with his claws, not with any weapon, he put an end to the demon king."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cada parte de la promesa de Brahma se había cumplido.",
          "en": "Every part of Brahma's promise had been kept."
        }
      ],
