        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero la furia de Narasimha no se calmaba. Ni los dioses se atrevían a acercarse.",
          "en": "But Narasimha's fury did not cool. Even the gods were afraid to come near him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ni siquiera Lakshmi, su esposa. Entonces Brahma le pidió al pequeño Prahlada que fuera él.",
          "en": "Not even Lakshmi, his wife, dared to. So Brahma asked little Prahlada to go."
        },
        {
          "es": "El niño se arrodilló y rezó. Poco a poco, el hombre león se calmó.",
          "en": "The boy knelt and prayed. Little by little, the man-lion grew calm."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Bhagavata Purana dice que Narasimha le puso la mano sobre la cabeza, con cariño.",
          "en": "The Bhagavata Purana says Narasimha placed his hand on the boy's head, with love."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Qué habrías hecho tú en el lugar de Prahlada?",
          "en": "What would you have done in Prahlada's place?"
        }
      ],
